mv-error-no-symlink-support = Anagraw-inek·inem n wammud ur yessefrak ara iseɣwan izamulen
mv-error-permission-denied = Tasiregt tettwagi
mv-error-inter-device-move-failed = Asmutti gar yibenkan ur yeddi ara: { $from } ɣer { $to }; ur yezmir ara ad yekkes anican: { $err }
