mv-help-force = Ur ssutur ara asentem uqbel asemselsi
mv-help-interactive = Ssutur asentem uqbel asemselsi
mv-help-no-clobber = Ur semselsi ara afaylu yellan
mv-help-strip-trailing-slashes = Kkes meṛṛa isekkilen '/' yellan di taggara n yal tiɣiret AƔBALU
mv-help-target-directory = Smutti meṛṛa tiɣirtin AƔBALU ɣer UKARAM
mv-about = Smutti AƔBALU ɣer TƔERWAḌT, neɣ aṭas n yiɣbula ɣer UKARAM.
mv-help-no-target-directory = Sefrek TƔERWAḌT am ufaylu amagnu
mv-help-verbose = Segzi ayen i yettwaxedmen
mv-help-progress =
    Sken afeggag n usfari.
    Tamawt: tawuri-a ur tettusefrak ara sɣur GNU coreutils.
mv-help-debug = Segzi amek i yettwanɣal ufaylu. Yessermad -v daɣen
mv-help-exchange = Beddel aɣbalu d tɣerwaḍt gar-asen (s wudem abelkam)
mv-help-selinux = Sbadu asatal n tɣellist SELinux n ufaylu n tɣerwaḍt s tawsit tamezwert
mv-help-context = Am -Z, neɣ ma yettwabder-d CTX, err asatal n tɣellist SELinux d CTX
mv-verbose-renamed = Yettwabeddel yisem { $from } -> { $to }
mv-verbose-renamed-with-backup = Yettwabeddel yisem { $from } -> { $to } (aḥraz: { $backup })
mv-verbose-exchanged = Ttwabeddlen gar-asen { $from } <-> { $to }
mv-after-help =
    Ma tettwabder ugar n yiwet n textiṛt gar -i, -f, -n, anagar taneggarut ara yettwaseqdacen.

    Ur smutti ara afaylu ur nelli ara d akaram ma tella yakan tɣerwaḍt-is u yerna azemzakud-is n usnifel d agdazal n win n uɣbalu neɣ d amaynut ugar-is ;
    zgel afaylu-nni s tsusmi, war tuccḍa. Ma asmutti yezger tilisa n unagraw n ifuyla, aserwes yettili
    akked uzemzakud n uɣbalu yettwagzemen ilmend n tseddi n unagraw n ifuyla n tɣerwaḍt d tin n teɣriwin n unagraw yettwasqedcen
    i umucceḍ n yizemzakuden ; aya yettḥadar ales n umahil ma ttwaselkamnt aṭas n tladna mv -u s yiwen n uɣbalu
    d yiwet n tɣerwaḍt. Taxtiṛt-a tettwazgel ma tettwabder daɣen textiṛt -n neɣ --no-clobber.
    Taxtiṛt --update tettak ugar n usenqed ɣef ifuyla yellan deg tɣerwaḍt ara yettwasemselsin, yerna azal-is yezmer ad yili d yiwen seg yizalen-a :

    - all D tamahelt tamezwert ma ur tettwabder ara textiṛt --update ; meṛṛa ifuyla yellan deg tɣerwaḍt ad ttwasemselsin.
    - none Am textiṛt --no-clobber, ulac afaylu deg tɣerwaḍt ara yettwasemselsin ; yerna azgal n ufaylu ur d-yeglu ara s tuccḍa.
    - older D tamahelt tamezwert ma tettwabder textiṛt --update ; ifuyla ad ttwasemselsin ma llan d iqburen ugar n ufaylu n uɣbalu i ten-id-iqabel.
